34F R ear pain  

Came in mainly for R earache x ~3 days. Says started as “just a niggle” now “a dull ache with the odd sharp jab”, worse lying on that side and when chewing. No obvious injury. Had a bit of a head cold last week, “kids at school all snotty again”, nose blocked then, now mostly better.  

